// TrackGenerationWorkflow:GenerationMaxAttempts) failures guarantees exhaustion without ever
// touching the fallback track's own (real) validation, since the forced count runs out first.
// `Attempts`/`CriticAttempts` on a fallback-completed track are always 1/0 —
// FallbackGenerateCandidateTrackExecutor resets both for the fallback track's own validation —
// so neither is a meaningful signal of how hard the pipeline tried; only the outcome is.
